// E: 처진 줄에 어깨를 접어 넌 셔츠와 발끝 방향이 다른 흰 양말 한 쌍.
@size 32 16
@cell 16
@palette palette.pal
@mat A linen 2
@mat B linen 3
@mat C linen 4
@mat D linen 5
@mat E linen 6
@mat p pine 2
@mat q pine 4
@mat t pine 5
@layer rope
@mblock 0 1
t..............................q
qp............................pq
..qqpp....................ppqq..
......qqqqppppppppppppqqqq......
@layer laundry
@mblock 3 3
.....t......q......t....q
.....p......p......p....p
...BDEEBBBBDCB.....CDD..CD
..BDEEDBAABDDCB....DED..DD
.BDEEDDDBBDDDCCB...DDC..DC
.BDDDCBDDDDDCBCCB..DDC..DC
.ABCC.BDEDDDC.BBA..DCB..DC
......BDEDDDCB.....DCB..DC
......BDEDDCCB....DDCB..DCB
......BDEDDCCB...BDDAB..DCCB
......BDEDDCCB....BBB...BCBA
......BCDDDCCB...................
......ABCCCCBA...................
